{"vid":"E3G-dsvZHGU","source":"E3G-dsvZHGU.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Hi Neil. How are you doing?"},{"t":1.5,"txt":"I'm very well, thank you Georgie. How are you?"},{"t":3.5,"txt":"I'm very well too."},{"t":6,"txt":"Neil, in this episode of Real Easy English we're talking"},{"t":9.7,"txt":"about complaining – that is when you say something is wrong,"},{"t":14.7,"txt":"or you have a problem and you want to tell someone about it."},{"t":17.7,"txt":"Yes. And people should remember that they can get a free worksheet"},{"t":22.3,"txt":"for this podcast at bbclearningenglish.com."},{"t":31.8,"txt":"I know that you have a recent experience with this, don't you?"},{"t":36.1,"txt":"Ah yes."},{"t":37.2,"txt":"Yeah, I booked somewhere to stay on a trip"},{"t":41.8,"txt":"and the reviews were all really good."},{"t":43.9,"txt":"And then when I checked again, the reviews were all really bad."},{"t":47.5,"txt":"Oh no! What were they about?"},{"t":49.9,"txt":"They said the place was dirty and things were broken."},{"t":52.6,"txt":"Oh no. What did you do? Have you been yet?"},{"t":56.7,"txt":"Not yet. No."},{"t":59.1,"txt":"So, what did you do?"},{"t":60.3,"txt":"I wrote to them."},{"t":62,"txt":"I sent them an email to say I was worried."},{"t":66.3,"txt":"And I asked them to assure me that the place would be clean"},{"t":71.6,"txt":"and working properly."},{"t":73.5,"txt":"OK. And did you get a response?"},{"t":75.9,"txt":"I did, but I really hated the whole process."},{"t":80.3,"txt":"Oh no! Why?"},{"t":82.2,"txt":"Because I don't like complaining."},{"t":84.2,"txt":"No, neither do I."},{"t":85.5,"txt":"I'm not very good at it."},{"t":86.9,"txt":"I don't like to make people feel bad."},{"t":89,"txt":"Even if there is a problem,"},{"t":90.6,"txt":"and I've paid for something and it should be a certain way,"},{"t":95,"txt":"but it's not and I'm entitled to complain, I still don't like it."},{"t":101.5,"txt":"I just feel..."},{"t":103,"txt":"yeah, I feel embarrassed about it."},{"t":105,"txt":"Yeah, it's not an easy thing to do, I think."},{"t":108.4,"txt":"I think I'm getting better with age."},{"t":111.1,"txt":"I think I'm getting braver."},{"t":113.6,"txt":"I had an experience a couple of weeks ago."},{"t":116.9,"txt":"Because I am subscribed to a food delivery service,"},{"t":122.6,"txt":"I get a box of food every week,"},{"t":125,"txt":"and the last two weeks the delivery has been very late and"},{"t":130.1,"txt":"I'm not happy about it."},{"t":132.5,"txt":"And so, I found the courage – found the bravery"},{"t":137.2,"txt":"to call up the customer service and complain."},{"t":141.3,"txt":"And I was very strong."},{"t":143.3,"txt":"And I asked for money – a discount on the next order."},{"t":147.7,"txt":"Wow, that sounds very well done."},{"t":151,"txt":"I think when you do complain, sometimes you feel bad about it."},{"t":157.9,"txt":"But if it works out well, like with you and hopefully with my accommodation..."},{"t":164,"txt":"Yes."},{"t":165,"txt":"...afterwards you feel really good."},{"t":166.9,"txt":"Yes."},{"t":167.6,"txt":"Because you did what was right."},{"t":171.2,"txt":"Yeah. If you've paid for something,"},{"t":173.7,"txt":"I think you can expect it to be what you paid for."},{"t":176.8,"txt":"So, if it isn't, I think you're allowed to..."},{"t":180,"txt":"you're allowed to complain."},{"t":181.1,"txt":"But there is a nice way to do it, isn't there?"},{"t":183.7,"txt":"There is, yeah. Be polite."},{"t":185.5,"txt":"Don't be personal."},{"t":187.5,"txt":"It's not often..."},{"t":188.8,"txt":"The person you are complaining to is often not the person responsible"},{"t":194.2,"txt":"for the mistake or whatever."},{"t":196.1,"txt":"Yeah."},{"t":196.8,"txt":"So, I think if you are respectful and polite but you know what you want."},{"t":202.5,"txt":"So Neil, you and I find complaining quite stressful"},{"t":207.2,"txt":"so we don't do it very often."},{"t":209.2,"txt":"But do you know anyone that complains all the time?"},{"t":212.3,"txt":"Oh yeah. Some people seem to love complaining"},{"t":216.8,"txt":"and they complain about things that I would not complain about."},{"t":221.6,"txt":"Yeah, I've been in restaurants with groups of people where there's been"},{"t":226,"txt":"someone that has complained about something that is really embarrassing,"},{"t":230.2,"txt":"and you just think this is not a real, big issue."},{"t":234,"txt":"Has that ever happened to you?"},{"t":235.5,"txt":"Yeah, the same thing."},{"t":237.1,"txt":"I've been having a meal with some friends"},{"t":240.4,"txt":"and one of the people I was with – he used to be a waiter,"},{"t":244.6,"txt":"and he had a very clear idea about how waiters should behave."},{"t":249.9,"txt":"And he didn't like something and he complained about it,"},{"t":254,"txt":"and nobody else really understood what he was talking about"},{"t":257.9,"txt":"or why he was complaining."},{"t":259.4,"txt":"And it was embarrassing."},{"t":261,"txt":"Did he complain to the waiter?"},{"t":263,"txt":"Yeah, but so everyone could hear."},{"t":265,"txt":"Oh no. And how did the waiter respond?"},{"t":269.5,"txt":"I don't think he liked it very much."},{"t":271.4,"txt":"Well, I used to work in restaurants."},{"t":274.4,"txt":"I've also worked in customer service,"},{"t":276.9,"txt":"but in restaurants, if people have a reason to complain,"},{"t":281.4,"txt":"of course I'm going to try to fix it."},{"t":284.8,"txt":"But it also depends how they say it."},{"t":289.1,"txt":"If they're very rude, as a waitress you don't really want to help them."},{"t":295.6,"txt":"But if they're polite and they have a reason to complain,"},{"t":298,"txt":"of course I'll try to fix their problems."},{"t":308.3,"txt":"OK. Neil, it's time to recap the vocabulary we used in this conversation."},{"t":313,"txt":"We used the verb 'complain', which is when you say something is wrong"},{"t":317.1,"txt":"or not good enough."},{"t":318.5,"txt":"And we also heard the noun 'complaint'."},{"t":321.2,"txt":"We did. And you 'make a complaint', don't you?"},{"t":323.7,"txt":"Yes. We also heard 'discount',"},{"t":326,"txt":"which is when you don't pay the full price of something."},{"t":329.3,"txt":"You also said that people are 'entitled' to something,"},{"t":333,"txt":"and it means that that is something they should get if they paid for it."},{"t":337.9,"txt":"And Neil, you said you were worried about the 'reviews' of the accommodation"},{"t":343.3,"txt":"for your trip, which is when people write what they think about the place."},{"t":348.3,"txt":"That's it then, Georgie, isn't it?"},{"t":350.2,"txt":"But join us again, another time for more Real Easy English."},{"t":353.6,"txt":"Don't forget, there's a free worksheet on the website."},{"t":355.9,"txt":"Goodbye for now."},{"t":356.9,"txt":"Goodbye."}],"words":[{"t":0.04,"w":"Hi"},{"t":0.04,"w":"Neil."},{"t":0.04,"w":"How"},{"t":0.04,"w":"are"},{"t":0.04,"w":"you"},{"t":0.04,"w":"doing?"},{"t":1.48,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.48,"w":"very"},{"t":1.48,"w":"well,"},{"t":1.48,"w":"thank"},{"t":1.48,"w":"you"},{"t":1.48,"w":"Georgie."},{"t":1.48,"w":"How"},{"t":1.48,"w":"are"},{"t":1.48,"w":"you?"},{"t":3.48,"w":"I'm"},{"t":3.48,"w":"very"},{"t":3.48,"w":"well"},{"t":3.48,"w":"too."},{"t":6.04,"w":"Neil,"},{"t":6.04,"w":"in"},{"t":6.04,"w":"this"},{"t":6.04,"w":"episode"},{"t":6.04,"w":"of"},{"t":6.04,"w":"Real"},{"t":6.04,"w":"Easy"},{"t":6.04,"w":"English"},{"t":6.04,"w":"we're"},{"t":6.04,"w":"talking"},{"t":9.72,"w":"about"},{"t":9.72,"w":"complaining"},{"t":9.72,"w":"–"},{"t":9.72,"w":"that"},{"t":9.72,"w":"is"},{"t":9.72,"w":"when"},{"t":9.72,"w":"you"},{"t":9.72,"w":"say"},{"t":9.72,"w":"something"},{"t":9.72,"w":"is"},{"t":9.72,"w":"wrong,"},{"t":14.72,"w":"or"},{"t":14.72,"w":"you"},{"t":14.72,"w":"have"},{"t":14.72,"w":"a"},{"t":14.72,"w":"problem"},{"t":14.72,"w":"and"},{"t":14.72,"w":"you"},{"t":14.72,"w":"want"},{"t":14.72,"w":"to"},{"t":14.72,"w":"tell"},{"t":14.72,"w":"someone"},{"t":14.72,